      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i’ve just run out. like there’s nothing left inside. all the colors are gone and i’m just staring at a blank canvas every day and feeling nothing. it’s not even sadness anymore, it’s just this massive, hollow emptiness. like the person i used to be is dead and there’s nothing left to replace them.",
